<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>OneCart | About Us</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            --emerald: #087e78;
            --deep-green: #123e3a;
            --mint: #e5f4f0;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --text: #243b39;
            --muted: #6b7c79;
            --border: #e1ebe8;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f8fbfa;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .top-bar {
            padding: 10px 5%;
            background: var(--deep-green);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: 18px 5%;
            background: white;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .logo {
            color: var(--emerald);
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .search-box {
            display: flex;
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 520px;
            min-width: 220px;
        }

        .search-box input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;
            outline: none;
        }

        .search-box button {
            padding: 0 18px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            background: var(--emerald);
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .header-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .header-links a:hover,
        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--emerald);
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            padding: 13px 5%;
            background: white;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        nav a {
            white-space: nowrap;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .about-hero {
            margin: 28px 5%;
            padding: 55px 6%;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(115deg, var(--mint), #f4fbf8);
        }

        .about-hero small {
            color: var(--emerald);
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            color: var(--deep-green);
            font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px);
            line-height: 1.15;
        }

        .about-hero p {
            max-width: 720px;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .section {
            margin: 35px 5%;
        }

        .section-heading {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .section-heading h2 {
            color: var(--deep-green);
            font-size: 26px;
        }

        .section-heading p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .about-card {
            padding: 26px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: white;
        }

        .about-icon {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: var(--mint);
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        .about-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--deep-green);
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .about-card p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .mission-panel {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 30px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .mission-panel h2 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: var(--deep-green);
            font-size: 25px;
        }

        .mission-panel p {
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .mission-highlight {
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: var(--mint);
            color: var(--deep-green);
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .about-cta {
            margin: 35px 5% 55px;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: var(--deep-green);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-cta h2 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 26px;
        }

        .about-cta p {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #d2e5e1;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .primary-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 22px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--emerald);
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .primary-button:hover {
            background: #096b66;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            background: var(--deep-green);
            color: white;
        }

        .footer-main {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1.5fr;
            gap: 30px;
            padding: 45px 5%;
        }

        .footer-brand h2 {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        .footer-brand p,
        .footer-column p {
            color: #d2e5e1;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .footer-column h3 {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .footer-column a {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #d2e5e1;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .footer-column a:hover {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: 18px 5%;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            color: #d2e5e1;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .about-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            }

            .footer-main {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                align-items: stretch;
            }

            .search-box {
                order: 3;
                max-width: none;
                flex-basis: 100%;
            }

            .about-hero {
                padding: 35px 7%;
            }

            .about-grid,
            .mission-panel,
            .footer-main {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .about-cta {
                padding: 28px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="top-bar">
        Discover products from multiple sellers, all in one place.
    </div>

    <header>
        <a class="logo" th:href="@{/}">OneCart</a>

        <form class="search-box" th:action="@{/}" method="get">
            <input type="text" name="search" placeholder="Search products...">
            <button type="submit">Search</button>
        </form>

        <div class="header-links">
            <a th:href="@{/wishlist}">
                ♡ Wishlist <span id="wishlist-count">0</span>
            </a>
            <a th:href="@{/cart}">
                🛒 Cart <span id="cart-count">0</span>
            </a>
            <a th:href="@{/login}">Login</a>
            <a th:href="@{/signup}">Sign Up</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a th:href="@{/}">Home</a>
        <a th:href="@{/#categories}">Categories</a>
        <a th:href="@{/#products}">Products</a>
        <a th:href="@{/#vendors}">Vendors</a>
        <a th:href="@{/about}">About</a>
        <a th:href="@{/contact}">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section class="about-hero">
            <small>About OneCart</small>
            <h1>One marketplace. Many sellers. Easy shopping.</h1>
            <p>
                OneCart brings products from different sellers together in one
                convenient marketplace. Our goal is to make it easier for shoppers
                to discover products and for vendors to reach more customers.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <h2>What OneCart Offers</h2>
                <p>
                    A simple shopping experience built around product discovery,
                    choice, and convenience.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-grid">
                <article class="about-card">
                    <div class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">🛍️</div>
                    <h3>Shop in One Place</h3>
                    <p>
                        Browse products from multiple sellers without needing
                        to visit separate stores.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="about-card">
                    <div class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏪</div>
                    <h3>Support Multiple Vendors</h3>
                    <p>
                        OneCart gives vendors a place to showcase their
                        businesses and make their products easier to discover.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="about-card">
                    <div class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">♡</div>
                    <h3>Convenient Discovery</h3>
                    <p>
                        Find products, save items to your wishlist, and keep
                        selected products together in your cart.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <div class="mission-panel">
                <div>
                    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
                    <p>
                        We aim to create a welcoming online marketplace where
                        customers can explore a variety of products and vendors
                        can present their stores in one shared space.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mission-highlight">
                    Making online shopping more connected, clear, and convenient.
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-cta">
            <h2>Explore OneCart</h2>
            <p>
                Browse featured products and discover the vendors behind them.
            </p>
            <a class="primary-button" th:href="@{/}">Start Shopping</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-main">
            <div class="footer-brand">
                <h2>OneCart</h2>
                <p>
                    One marketplace. Many sellers. Easy shopping.
                    Discover products from independent vendors in one place.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-column">
                <h3>Quick Links</h3>
                <a th:href="@{/}">Home</a>
                <a th:href="@{/#categories}">Categories</a>
                <a th:href="@{/#products}">Products</a>
                <a th:href="@{/#vendors}">Vendors</a>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-column">
                <h3>Help &amp; Information</h3>
                <a th:href="@{/about}">About Us</a>
                <a th:href="@{/contact}">Contact Us</a>
                <a th:href="@{/login}">Login</a>
                <a th:href="@{/signup}">Create Account</a>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-column">
                <h3>For Sellers</h3>
                <p>Want to sell on OneCart?</p>
                <a th:href="@{/signup}">Join as a Vendor →</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <span>© 2026 OneCart. All rights reserved.</span>
            <span>Designed for easy, convenient shopping.</span>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>